For more information, see ASP.NET Core middleware.

Developer exception page

Microsoft.AspNetCore.Builder.WebApplication.CreateBuilder*?displayProperty=nameWithType initializes a new instance of the Microsoft.AspNetCore.Builder.WebApplicationBuilder class with preconfigured defaults. The developer exception page is enabled in the preconfigured defaults. When the following code is run in the development environment, navigating to / renders a friendly page that shows the exception.

    var builder = WebApplication.CreateBuilder(args);

